  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Season the lamb shoulder with salt and pepper.",
    "Roast the lamb shoulder in the oven for 20 minutes per pound, or until it reaches an internal temperature of 145 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Let the lamb rest for 10 minutes before slicing it thinly.",
    "Grill the wholegrain pita bread for 2 minutes per side, or until it is lightly toasted.",
    "Spread a layer of feta cheese on each pita bread.",
    "Top the feta cheese with sliced lamb, kalamata olives, artichoke hearts, and sun-dried tomatoes.",
    "Garnish with fresh parsley and wrap each pita bread in a lotus leaf."
